# Bookstore Website

A PHP-based web application for browsing products, registering, logging in, and placing orders.

## Features
- User registration
- Login system
- Product browsing
- Ordering process
- Session management

## Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- PHP
- MySQL


## Project Overview
This project was originally hosted on a university server environment. 
The source code and project assets are included in this repository for portfolio purposes.

## Setup
This project requires a PHP and MySQL environment to run locally. 
The exact configuration will need to be adjusted based on the local setup and database details.

## Notes
This repository is intended to showcase the source code and project work rather than provide a live hosted demo.
